  "body": "## What changed\n\n- **Stock page shows stock only.** `stock_page` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs`) no longer draws the Machine, Post and Theme sections. Machine and Post stay editable on their setup nodes (`setup_pages.rs` still calls `pages::machine_section` / `pages::post_section`).\n- **Theme ribbon door.** New `Cmd::Theme` cell, \"Theme…\", right of \"Panels…\" in the View group (`panes.rs`). Its dropdown lives in a new module, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme_drop.rs`, and follows the same hand-drawn popup rules as the View and Machine doors: one door open at a time, and a press outside closes it. It lists Dark, Light, the discovered `assets/themes/*.json` files by name, and Browse... (the load-a-theme-file pick), then the colour-vision modes, which used to sit inside the old theme section. Picks queue `SelectTheme` / `SelectThemeDialog` / `SelectColorVision`, so Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+Y work. Opening the door is view state (`State::ribbon_theme_open`).\n- `colorvision::picker` (the old combo) was removed because nothing uses it any more.\n- No icon on the door: nothing in the bundled Tabler set fits, so the cell uses its caption, like the View door. Decisions are in `docs/decisions/441-stock-page-theme-button.md`. The old \"Built-in\" reset button was dropped because the Dark row queues the same command.\n\n## How tested\n\nPinning tests (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/theme_door.rs`):\n- `the_stock_page_has_no_machine_post_or_theme_controls`\n- `the_theme_door_sits_right_of_panels`\n- `the_theme_door_switches_the_theme_and_undo_restores_it` (undo and redo)\n- `the_theme_door_carries_the_colour_vision_modes` (pick, then undo)\n- `machine_and_post_stay_editable_on_their_setup_nodes`, plus the existing `setup_tree::the_machine_and_post_pages_render_for_a_setup`\n\nUpdated tests:\n- `a_lathe_over_a_mill_post_offers_the_lathe_post_and_rides_undo` now drives the post offer from the setup's Post node instead of the Stock page.\n- `tips_match_the_imgui_table` now includes the Theme tip.\n- `every_ribbon_cell_of_every_workspace_wears_a_glyph` now skips the Theme door, as it already did the View door.\n\nGate:\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` (CWD `crates/ui`): 315 passed, 2 ignored.\n- `--test operations` and `--test theme_files`: pass.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nSnapshots `egui_app.png`, `egui_app_light.png` and `egui_tool_editor.png` were regenerated. The diff image showed changes only in the ribbon row (the new cell reflows it), and I inspected the new image.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No GUI launch (by policy). The Browse... file dialog was not clicked through.\n- App crates are untouched, so no app suites were run.\n\nChangelog: The Stock page shows stock only; the theme and colour-vision picks moved to a new Theme ribbon button right of Panels (#441)\n\nFixes #441\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
